# Uber Ride Analytics Dashboard | Power BI

## Project Overview
Developed an interactive Power BI dashboard to explore Uber bookings,
revenue, cancellations, ride distances, vehicle types, and demand
across time slots.

## Key Features
- Summarized booking volume and revenue through key metrics.
- Analyzed cancellation patterns.
- Compared booking demand across vehicle types.
- Explored ride distances and time-slot demand.
- Presented findings through interactive charts and visual summaries.

## Business and Marketing Insights
- Explore customer preferences across vehicle types.
- Identify peak demand periods to inform promotional planning.
- Examine cancellation trends to support customer experience discussions.
- Support business decisions with clear visual comparisons.

## Stakeholder Communication
- Present key metrics in an easy-to-understand format.
- Translate booking patterns into business discussion points.
- Use dashboard visuals to support presentations covering findings,
  business implications, and recommended next steps.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI

## Outcome
Demonstrates data visualization and storytelling skills by turning
ride-booking data into insights for business stakeholders.
Developed an interactive Power BI dashboard to analyze Uber bookings, revenue, cancellations, ride distance, and vehicle preferences.
Visualized demand across time slots to help identify peak booking periods and customer usage patterns.
Presented key metrics in a clear format to support business and marketing discussions.
Highlighted insights relevant to customer engagement, targeted promotions, and service improvement.
Provided a foundation for stakeholder presentation decks summarizing key findings, business implications, and actionable recommendations.

